      "text": "Limb (d) of POL-NS-01 is satisfied on its own terms: the record shows no boarding event, a termination by the driver at 13:34:24, and cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, one of the three codes that limb (d) recognises. The driver did not enter DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE, the one code that is his own admission he could not find the rider, so the code recorded is an accurate description of what he observed and is not a mis-selected reason code.",
